<title>CHINA: China 1996 copper output up 5.71 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China 1996 copper output up 5.71 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 909,700 tonnes of copper in 1996, up 5.71 percent from 1995, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Copper output in December alone was 85,300 tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
